  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1701.04 Water Quality Standards Variances. Water quality standards variances as defined in 40 CFR 131.3(o) shall be issued in accordance with 40 CFR § 131.14 and the commissioner’s rulemaking authority under RSA 485-A:6, I, XI-c, XIV and XV and RSA 485-A:8, VI.\n\nSource. #14203, eff 2-26-25",
